window.EXAUD={"Work in pairs and act out the dialogue.": "audio/cau/9f80b4a8118b33e2.mp3", "We must act quickly to save water.": "audio/cau/2f2b0156a6f07db9.mp3", "We need to take action to keep our school clean.": "audio/cau/0c8076052760d1f1.mp3", "Lan is very active, and her quick action helped her friend.": "audio/cau/aa0ee4199314c27b.mp3", "My little brother is very active.": "audio/cau/ee888778c322e79a.mp3", "Hoa is active and enjoys every club activity.": "audio/cau/a7bbb816806174db.mp3", "She actively takes part in class.": "audio/cau/3744bd9a9d414fa7.mp3", "We actively help clean the beach.": "audio/cau/886d6508a571df0e.mp3", "Swimming is my favourite activity.": "audio/cau/f1504092a266a13a.mp3", "Hoa is an active girl, and dancing is her best activity.": "audio/cau/3d7dcf03c6c96451.mp3", "'Kind' is an adjective that describes people.": "audio/cau/e79678700752e8de.mp3", "Find one adjective in this sentence: Lan is clever.": "audio/cau/543a075275273447.mp3", "Kind and friendly are adjectives.": "audio/cau/571da65dd4451319.mp3", "Find two adjectives in each sentence.": "audio/cau/e83a6ada9ad972af.mp3", "We must keep our traditional crafts alive.": "audio/cau/461c910cfd0f1264.mp3", "The old tree is still alive, but that one is dead.": "audio/cau/713514d344b69a38.mp3", "Lan likes music. She also likes drawing.": "audio/cau/a42927a6760bdc56.mp3", "Nam speaks English and also learns Japanese.": "audio/cau/d657bddc45a35d0d.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Please answer the teacher's question.": "audio/cau/f790ccdd60f40ece.mp3", "Nam asks and Hoa answers.": "audio/cau/128cffcafde831b9.mp3", "Check your answers with a partner.": "audio/cau/8656910f569b2925.mp3", "Lan can answer all the questions, and her answers are correct.": "audio/cau/df2a478d26596242.mp3", "The sun appeared after the rain.": "audio/cau/720885e25ae366ec.mp3", "Stars appear at night.": "audio/cau/c5d17a416347cd40.mp3", "Describe your best friend's appearance.": "audio/cau/fd6bc3447c428dd2.mp3", "Minh's appearance changed, but his smile did not disappear.": "audio/cau/895a7b39715b47bf.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "You can ask your teacher for help.": "audio/cau/675c99f05fae3d5e.mp3", "Phong asked a question, and Mi answered it.": "audio/cau/ad374096f949206b.mp3", "Nam asked his teacher a question.": "audio/cau/4879a0b703b8484f.mp3", "Mi asks a lot of questions; yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/1884bf7fdb16c86c.mp3", "Lan is asking her mother about dinner.": "audio/cau/28eda1c06b5eacae.mp3", "Nam asks a lot, and now he is asking again.": "audio/cau/c563c3f4819710c9.mp3", "Minh asks his friend for a pen.": "audio/cau/463760cf3bb33508.mp3", "Hoa often asks questions, and yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/99ce048ae007844f.mp3", "I attend Le Loi Secondary School.": "audio/cau/2106fb1a21b48167.mp3", "Many people attended the festival.": "audio/cau/d86fc7a983ad38ca.mp3", "Please pay attention to the teacher.": "audio/cau/9cbf379be0e4f13b.mp3", "Lan is an attentive student who pays attention in class.": "audio/cau/991bd7e8b14790af.mp3", "Be attentive in class.": "audio/cau/4c32da426c39662a.mp3", "She is an attentive listener.": "audio/cau/59ab0971a228f869.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "I believe you.": "audio/cau/c1b7bfc3adc01b41.mp3", "Do you believe in ghosts?": "audio/cau/83a7564931d63151.mp3", "Lan is my best friend.": "audio/cau/9edc7bdf247f31c3.mp3", "Mi's drawing is good, Nam's is better, but Hoa's is the best.": "audio/cau/c2336133ff2dce7f.mp3", "Life in the city is better for me.": "audio/cau/1aaaaca243bd56b5.mp3", "Lan's drawing is good, Mi's is better, and Hoa's is the best.": "audio/cau/eb8986ba6f0ca74b.mp3", "What is your date of birth?": "audio/cau/e7aed363d3bf5a54.mp3", "Hoa was born in Hue, so Hue is her place of birth.": "audio/cau/aa514b0287a77c38.mp3", "Happy birthday, Mi!": "audio/cau/f1ae6fa2fd0a78d1.mp3", "Nam was born in May, so his birthday is in May.": "audio/cau/870217b5fec80b92.mp3", "We write our birthdays on the board.": "audio/cau/56e235ee15633bfc.mp3", "Lan's birthday is in June, and our birthdays are close.": "audio/cau/613a4688ac7394dc.mp3", "My cat has black fur.": "audio/cau/a0b2fea708bf6f41.mp3", "Mi has black hair and a white shirt.": "audio/cau/ccf0d3ad0aca7115.mp3", "Long speeches bore me.": "audio/cau/8caeb0926b488ee3.mp3", "I don't want to bore you with details.": "audio/cau/0053023504c797f2.mp3", "I'm bored. Let's go out.": "audio/cau/349dce422beb0ca4.mp3", "She gets bored with the same games.": "audio/cau/5538b000e1d9a2cc.mp3", "Reading helps me fight boredom.": "audio/cau/50e83619a7ea3b82.mp3", "He played games out of boredom.": "audio/cau/d68f7ca31f034697.mp3", "The film was long and boring.": "audio/cau/2fb37c98bad76a4f.mp3", "The lesson was boring, so Nam felt bored.": "audio/cau/0b9b11807d964d8b.mp3", "I was born in Ha Noi in 2010.": "audio/cau/1184e3ce650521d2.mp3", "Lan was born in Hue, and her birthday is in May.": "audio/cau/c0547063561aa5a4.mp3", "Hoa is a bright student.": "audio/cau/505049821b13285a.mp3", "The sun shines brightly on a bright morning.": "audio/cau/8688428d91bd1a20.mp3", "Flowers brighten the room.": "audio/cau/287bde82cbe44f13.mp3", "Her smile brightens my day.": "audio/cau/ab55c1836fa0f283.mp3", "The sun is shining brightly.": "audio/cau/fd5f9c5d1016586c.mp3", "The houses are brightly painted.": "audio/cau/bb9744e8655f1d1b.mp3", "Turn down the brightness of your screen.": "audio/cau/07947a19596f9a53.mp3", "The brightness of the sun hurts my eyes.": "audio/cau/72f94863a1aea9bf.mp3", "Minh has brown eyes.": "audio/cau/1298ce7cea306747.mp3", "My dog is brown and black.": "audio/cau/848a13899fbc938d.mp3", "My mum is always busy at weekends.": "audio/cau/e860f8923617b0aa.mp3", "Hoa is busy today, but she is free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/1d5a0a62fb11072c.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "The first iPhone came in 2007.": "audio/cau/b74af45c313ce91a.mp3", "Lan came to my house, and then we went to the park.": "audio/cau/db2ce9de70166e15.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "Old people in my village need special care.": "audio/cau/e2b32589dc4d57eb.mp3", "Lan takes care of her little brother very carefully.": "audio/cau/0449e85740a5edad.mp3", "Be careful when you cross the road.": "audio/cau/7d44eca76d25a07d.mp3", "Nam is careful, so he writes carefully.": "audio/cau/3961f897eee5f47e.mp3", "Listen carefully and repeat after me.": "audio/cau/ad3f1bf6d7562211.mp3", "Mi is careful, so she always writes carefully.": "audio/cau/6be5befe9f5467c7.mp3", "Don't be careless with fire.": "audio/cau/3fa8f5ce401f56eb.mp3", "He made a careless mistake.": "audio/cau/0e576f1b557d8217.mp3", "My grandmother is kind and caring.": "audio/cau/a03423bedfa41d41.mp3", "Hoa is caring. She takes care of her little sister.": "audio/cau/7cc44adf2286a858.mp3", "Be cautious when you cross the road.": "audio/cau/9dd111c2f2e4c687.mp3", "She is a cautious driver.": "audio/cau/b817922787a617d7.mp3", "Tấm is the main character in the story.": "audio/cau/809b3508d2cedfc9.mp3", "She has a kind character.": "audio/cau/33ae03fcd7ecd7ad.mp3", "There are three characters in the story.": "audio/cau/42f47ac3ecb92dd4.mp3", "I like the characters in this cartoon.": "audio/cau/1cc0f45bc548a362.mp3", "There are forty students in my class.": "audio/cau/69f347ac209b4fc2.mp3", "Nam is my classmate. We are in the same class.": "audio/cau/e6a0aa2aaff4be27.mp3", "Our school has twenty classes.": "audio/cau/c3a891dc027e3741.mp3", "We have English classes on Monday.": "audio/cau/cd49a2bc4c3e1c86.mp3", "Nam is my new classmate.": "audio/cau/8f038868644223fc.mp3", "My classmate and I sit in the same classroom.": "audio/cau/ebc5ea3d6e23a8ba.mp3", "Our classroom is on the second floor.": "audio/cau/c460b559d453bdeb.mp3", "My classmates and I clean the classroom on Fridays.": "audio/cau/9cf5ce52e3da16c8.mp3", "Minh is a clever boy.": "audio/cau/620f8c5f3017a282.mp3", "Lan is clever. She answers the questions cleverly.": "audio/cau/2720a9ae3428f690.mp3", "She answered the question cleverly.": "audio/cau/b127f7ca5556eeca.mp3", "The robot is cleverly designed.": "audio/cau/78c94fc4362f7380.mp3", "Everyone praised his cleverness.": "audio/cau/8a333324f6d5417b.mp3", "The fox is known for its cleverness.": "audio/cau/165b55f081837120.mp3", "I join the English club on Fridays.": "audio/cau/4854d8e45991624d.mp3", "Hoa is in the art club at school.": "audio/cau/1bf4d645fed3a1be.mp3", "Please come to my birthday party.": "audio/cau/6800288294234b0b.mp3", "Nam came to school early yesterday.": "audio/cau/e4484967a289b802.mp3", "Success comes from hard work.": "audio/cau/104997cf355813ab.mp3", "Minh comes to school early, but yesterday he came late.": "audio/cau/8fc163a4c3b546e2.mp3", "My new friend is coming to my house.": "audio/cau/364032ec5fb1b2d1.mp3", "Lan came yesterday, and Hoa is coming today.": "audio/cau/2a3f62b0b9c0734e.mp3", "Speaking English gives me confidence.": "audio/cau/0214e9fa530e6659.mp3", "She answered with confidence.": "audio/cau/d89b3c81baec6292.mp3", "Phong feels confident before the test.": "audio/cau/7a19526f5070486e.mp3", "Lan was shy, but now she speaks confidently.": "audio/cau/12ff535fa02bf353.mp3", "He spoke confidently in front of the class.": "audio/cau/472a60af17760a83.mp3", "Walk confidently onto the stage.": "audio/cau/4b1bbb9324fc0c5c.mp3", "Connect the laptop to the Internet.": "audio/cau/083f71db481310ee.mp3", "The bridge connects two villages.": "audio/cau/b1569f595ecaee4e.mp3", "Listen to the conversation and answer.": "audio/cau/9f48e7934c974946.mp3", "Mi had a short chat, not a long conversation.": "audio/cau/e32ab06f1cea65e6.mp3", "Lan creates a to-do list every Sunday evening.": "audio/cau/87a26e3235a8f368.mp3", "Our class created a poster about healthy living.": "audio/cau/97dc8c8a67b315e5.mp3", "This dish is the chef's own creation.": "audio/cau/fc920ec6ff357284.mp3", "The creation of the park took two years.": "audio/cau/e03b9893206b7583.mp3", "Hoa is very creative in art class.": "audio/cau/d1a85d15ebb2ea7b.mp3", "Nam is creative. He likes to create new games.": "audio/cau/a92d851d2aed43a0.mp3", "Art lessons help students show their creativity.": "audio/cau/ef2eb572bc331261.mp3", "Phong is creative, and his creativity makes our class fun.": "audio/cau/c91d4b0dff266adb.mp3", "He is the creator of this cartoon.": "audio/cau/acc70c5a959cdcc3.mp3", "She is a young content creator.": "audio/cau/e8d143a8558b806e.mp3", "She has beautiful curls.": "audio/cau/6636eb252844f2b1.mp3", "The cat curled up on the sofa.": "audio/cau/d3b874d67ee4644a.mp3", "My sister has long curly hair.": "audio/cau/6015022e68736fb5.mp3", "Mi's hair is curly, but Lan's hair is straight.": "audio/cau/13f8f82b13177e0c.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "It is dark outside now.": "audio/cau/48eaca11c1014cbe.mp3", "Minh's room is dark, so he turns on the light.": "audio/cau/8c6105f992faba73.mp3", "Can you describe your house?": "audio/cau/a0d5ad73f19e51bc.mp3", "Describe your friend and read your description to the class.": "audio/cau/5e8b000dcde9e11f.mp3", "Write a short description of your friend.": "audio/cau/1d3f9d3cf060662c.mp3", "Phong describes his school, and his description is funny.": "audio/cau/9801d95651b1cda6.mp3", "Read the descriptions and guess the person.": "audio/cau/20055a561b18e782.mp3", "Mi can describe people well, and her descriptions are fun.": "audio/cau/84984e9d66cc50f9.mp3", "Write a descriptive paragraph about your room.": "audio/cau/053c0911268b28bb.mp3", "Use descriptive words like 'tall' and 'kind'.": "audio/cau/05df1ce0b4bb46d0.mp3", "Listen and read the dialogue between Elena and her mum.": "audio/cau/9a5885f30068091c.mp3", "Nam and Mai practise the dialogue in pairs.": "audio/cau/01a1645442093c5c.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "Customs differ from country to country.": "audio/cau/867f1b35e7b382a9.mp3", "The twins differ in character.": "audio/cau/6fe7387847575daa.mp3", "What is the difference between these pictures?": "audio/cau/6c98c14e1c41bd67.mp3", "Small actions can make a big difference.": "audio/cau/2df232067e45e4a5.mp3", "My house is different from yours.": "audio/cau/5abda8894fc87510.mp3", "Lan and Mi are different; the difference is their hobbies.": "audio/cau/fd7e006914631783.mp3", "People think differently.": "audio/cau/f177b3ef34202d8f.mp3", "The word is spelled differently in American English.": "audio/cau/f1593ad480f9bd47.mp3", "Maths is difficult for me.": "audio/cau/16bb57fb47e5df02.mp3", "This test is difficult, but that one is easy.": "audio/cau/56b22511f0d64b7c.mp3", "The sun disappeared behind the clouds.": "audio/cau/11fe510042a50c97.mp3", "Many animals may disappear forever.": "audio/cau/521cb2c0bd5d4075.mp3", "The disappearance of the forest is sad.": "audio/cau/a955560c619a520c.mp3", "Police are looking into his disappearance.": "audio/cau/3d686321342cae6f.mp3", "I dislike noisy and crowded places.": "audio/cau/5ace2bb2616bf75c.mp3", "Mi likes cats, but she dislikes dogs.": "audio/cau/a21ccd81f7c8d400.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "Mi doesn't like milk very much.": "audio/cau/63a58b0dc618ef2d.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but Minh doesn't do it.": "audio/cau/362bb11ca0696388.mp3", "What are you doing now?": "audio/cau/cc6dbef7715013a7.mp3", "Lan is doing her homework, and she did the maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/c6619d790ec63e61.mp3", "I don't like rainy days.": "audio/cau/111328217b7f4b84.mp3", "We don't play games, but Minh does.": "audio/cau/851ce9fc9da85e82.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "Can you draw a cat?": "audio/cau/be2932fbc93e80e5.mp3", "Hoa drew a flower and gave me the drawing.": "audio/cau/8ef26c64079b1115.mp3", "Lan's drawing is on the wall.": "audio/cau/e1c99913c9bb1dcf.mp3", "Minh draws well. He drew this drawing yesterday.": "audio/cau/a06a821e60587e14.mp3", "Have you drawn a picture of your family?": "audio/cau/a0d1c0f1a36ef4c7.mp3", "This map was drawn by my brother.": "audio/cau/eaf88a36f69101ec.mp3", "My brother draws pictures of animals.": "audio/cau/f72f002c0ce9c3b5.mp3", "Mi draws every day, and last week she drew a horse.": "audio/cau/c53f78fbfbf3ff78.mp3", "He drew a cat on the board.": "audio/cau/60aeb1a679f13bef.mp3", "We drew pictures in the art lesson.": "audio/cau/cffb3f0aaad7fa4f.mp3", "Life in the countryside can be dull for some teens.": "audio/cau/0347cee2d305ff73.mp3", "The film was dull, but the book was exciting.": "audio/cau/8b56307431aca227.mp3", "This English exercise is very easy.": "audio/cau/708befc5d340e6e4.mp3", "This question is easy, but that one is difficult.": "audio/cau/6ec1dbc0277d41ef.mp3", "The bottle is empty.": "audio/cau/91218cfd5cf480c1.mp3", "The streets are empty at night.": "audio/cau/cda748ee10a24d42.mp3", "The soldiers fought the enemy bravely.": "audio/cau/d7e74b5bf24e5f1e.mp3", "The cat is the enemy of the mouse.": "audio/cau/9cbb92de9d0d7660.mp3", "Our PE teacher is very energetic.": "audio/cau/0f20bc2cdf1fdbbc.mp3", "I feel energetic after a good sleep.": "audio/cau/38346e6197dce33e.mp3", "We have English on Monday.": "audio/cau/6e580c9a3bf7deb6.mp3", "Nam wants to study English in England.": "audio/cau/babe058c930ffd1c.mp3", "I enjoy living in the city.": "audio/cau/1cc10e53aebeec12.mp3", "We enjoy the trip because it is very enjoyable.": "audio/cau/1a682a8a24ff63b3.mp3", "City life is exciting for teens.": "audio/cau/28945e456a70e4ca.mp3", "The trip was exciting, so we were very excited.": "audio/cau/53c60dbfd0e789cf.mp3", "Look at the audience and make eye contact.": "audio/cau/c4b16bbbce49770b.mp3", "Lan has big eyes and long black hair.": "audio/cau/15209ecb4d490c7b.mp3", "Mi has big black eyes.": "audio/cau/2dc803b2e1e6b728.mp3", "Close your eyes and touch your left eye.": "audio/cau/11b06c9c51e8a07e.mp3", "Is this sentence true or false?": "audio/cau/b08a12186b6dfb5e.mp3", "That answer is false, but Hoa's answer is true.": "audio/cau/493842939182df2a.mp3", "We had a fantastic holiday.": "audio/cau/f32cf4ee7488001e.mp3", "The view from the top is fantastic.": "audio/cau/e447250983ededde.mp3", "Fill in the gaps with the correct words.": "audio/cau/fdb1b1c53693f72e.mp3", "Mi fills the glass, and now it is full.": "audio/cau/ebdf9cc5c316901a.mp3", "Focus on the main events in his life.": "audio/cau/568e05bcb3ccde4d.mp3", "It's noisy, so Mi can't concentrate or focus on homework.": "audio/cau/e984cbce9e79c312.mp3", "Don't forget your homework!": "audio/cau/42bcd3e580da9477.mp3", "Hoa forgot her book, but she remembered her pen.": "audio/cau/4fd2b5e71375a59b.mp3", "What do you do in your free time?": "audio/cau/561d82e572a21e67.mp3", "I am busy today, but I am free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/ed0144aa5c166e1b.mp3", "Nothing is more precious than independence and freedom.": "audio/cau/c78680a19317fb70.mp3", "Teenagers want more freedom.": "audio/cau/e07eefd97e88854b.mp3", "Animals move freely in the national park.": "audio/cau/25e7ba19bac40728.mp3", "You can speak freely here.": "audio/cau/7323942bb0641fc5.mp3", "Lan is my good friend.": "audio/cau/dd872f787d0777d3.mp3", "My friend Minh is very friendly.": "audio/cau/4f7040d4f93a465f.mp3", "Tourists love the friendliness of local people.": "audio/cau/a40be7352a7002db.mp3", "Her friendliness makes everyone happy.": "audio/cau/a90e79e9d7f1fffe.mp3", "Our new teacher is very friendly.": "audio/cau/0062f01a22f8a341.mp3", "Nam is friendly and has many friends.": "audio/cau/1865a7313d83db0c.mp3", "Mi and Lan are good friends.": "audio/cau/4315a79df8d3aac1.mp3", "Nam is friendly, so he makes friends easily.": "audio/cau/50b0e863c6e406f4.mp3", "Our friendship is very important to me.": "audio/cau/01f0404c79a2081f.mp3", "Lan and Hoa are close friends; their friendship is strong.": "audio/cau/9389591d845cf52e.mp3", "Write short notes, not full sentences.": "audio/cau/14bb97e16bb6d06a.mp3", "The bus was full, but the next one was empty.": "audio/cau/cfd981c78ac3d787.mp3", "After a good sleep, Lan is fully alert in class.": "audio/cau/e731cef6fdf5dd54.mp3", "Minh hasn't fully recovered from his cold.": "audio/cau/8cd54850c26f30ee.mp3", "We have fun at the summer camp.": "audio/cau/042795d03f276893.mp3", "The game was fun, and Nam's jokes were funny.": "audio/cau/1343a6a406625409.mp3", "My uncle is very funny.": "audio/cau/3365f3c2b0a43869.mp3", "Phong is funny, so playing with him is fun.": "audio/cau/754492bd17fda5cf.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "My grandmother has a small garden.": "audio/cau/ad0b9ba5604dc0f5.mp3", "Grandpa loves gardening, so our garden is beautiful.": "audio/cau/2afdcb2a5601fa6f.mp3", "The gardener waters the flowers every day.": "audio/cau/22a67e0a027f6f3e.mp3", "My grandpa is a good gardener.": "audio/cau/ab1e7c940217b2ba.mp3", "My grandpa enjoys gardening in his free time.": "audio/cau/fcd49413f27e2295.mp3", "Gardening is fun, and our garden looks beautiful.": "audio/cau/59d0b9e54bc0416e.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "We often go to the beach; last summer we went to Nha Trang.": "audio/cau/9dac5f396b6a209e.mp3", "Mi goes to school by bike.": "audio/cau/c289e58e0081ccad.mp3", "Nam usually goes swimming, but yesterday he went to the park.": "audio/cau/913dc197023c0f8a.mp3", "We are going to visit Hoi An.": "audio/cau/caf0fb980152def1.mp3", "Lan is going to school now; she goes by bus.": "audio/cau/c4af9d8c2b576c6c.mp3", "Mum has gone to the market.": "audio/cau/85901dafd6c6e677.mp3", "The rain has gone.": "audio/cau/42856535a7f42416.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "Your help is greatly appreciated.": "audio/cau/3e7c4dbae7d688f3.mp3", "Technology has greatly changed our lives.": "audio/cau/718fe374663a2930.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "My mother has long black hair.": "audio/cau/41b2fceab317cdd9.mp3", "Phong's hair is short because he had a haircut.": "audio/cau/63f3438257726452.mp3", "I need a haircut.": "audio/cau/7d93abbd1c7b72f7.mp3", "Do you like my new haircut?": "audio/cau/f47102da0cfc35d6.mp3", "My aunt is a hairdresser.": "audio/cau/08be3cd9c8f14bf9.mp3", "I go to the hairdresser's once a month.": "audio/cau/a2858025cc239abe.mp3", "My dog has long, hairy ears.": "audio/cau/041d7835247f9da0.mp3", "The spider has hairy legs.": "audio/cau/f2a919f0ec51fd15.mp3", "The maths test was very hard.": "audio/cau/0fd61471858155e3.mp3", "Minh works hard; he is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/32c549e4a9f6fc13.mp3", "I could hardly hear the teacher.": "audio/cau/144fb5f35860f6c9.mp3", "He hardly ever eats vegetables.": "audio/cau/2dbec027597d3ff1.mp3", "Lan is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/5b3ff11d5293f4e5.mp3", "Nam is hardworking, and he never gets lazy.": "audio/cau/06cd2484f9437f49.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I hate waiting for the bus in the rain.": "audio/cau/3f99a8ce5b4ab56c.mp3", "Nam likes city life, but he hates traffic jams.": "audio/cau/6300158d6a0d3117.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "Can you help me with my homework?": "audio/cau/59064ec1f34486d3.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she always helps her mum cook.": "audio/cau/82b6e08d58022ab1.mp3", "A street cleaner is a community helper.": "audio/cau/4e5627311f32688c.mp3", "The helper always helps old people cross the road.": "audio/cau/5d453af4870fad09.mp3", "The map is very helpful for tourists.": "audio/cau/01dfa6b6d0d2dc96.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she often helps her neighbours.": "audio/cau/28366edc55c3b71c.mp3", "Highlight the new words in yellow.": "audio/cau/d498bca60b2480af.mp3", "The highlight of the trip was the cave.": "audio/cau/70cc00f7daf64e62.mp3", "Match each highlighted word with its definition.": "audio/cau/2054b6647f7ccadc.mp3", "Lan highlighted the new words with a yellow highlighter.": "audio/cau/ecd4a9023406bc13.mp3", "I use a pink highlighter for key words.": "audio/cau/a9c241d4fed9b266.mp3", "Can I borrow your highlighter?": "audio/cau/dc25525dc68ae2af.mp3", "I go home at five o'clock.": "audio/cau/a74ab800c921a80b.mp3", "After school, Mi does her homework at home.": "audio/cau/ecaf6456acc0b85d.mp3", "I felt homesick on my first day at camp.": "audio/cau/4d3a402933ae59e2.mp3", "Students studying abroad often feel homesick.": "audio/cau/ea48648e9a7d5f77.mp3", "Nam does his homework at home every evening.": "audio/cau/0c529025b7e7c4aa.mp3", "Our house is near the river.": "audio/cau/462620c6e9d42610.mp3", "Lan's house is big, so the housework takes a long time.": "audio/cau/ffae3b516fc16794.mp3", "Lan helps her mother with the housework.": "audio/cau/603758dd29202743.mp3", "I do housework at weekends, like cleaning the house.": "audio/cau/603861c40de6e77e.mp3", "He was poor. However, he never gave up.": "audio/cau/893555bad2aff789.mp3", "It rained. However, Nam still went to school, but late.": "audio/cau/97115d20f691f7e4.mp3", "My teacher is very humorous.": "audio/cau/8f6ba9ed4e3a796d.mp3", "I read a humorous story yesterday.": "audio/cau/d81d0caf2c1c6edb.mp3", "That's a good idea!": "audio/cau/5032b596323554f3.mp3", "Nam has an idea for our project about houses.": "audio/cau/db4e4feff1dcab04.mp3", "Children are very imaginative.": "audio/cau/b79c2430e0adaf24.mp3", "She wrote an imaginative story.": "audio/cau/313d8314337fb59d.mp3", "Watching TV all day makes you inactive.": "audio/cau/41590c23ceb7a257.mp3", "The volcano has been inactive for years.": "audio/cau/6cfc968444b1c2e9.mp3", "Dolphins are intelligent animals.": "audio/cau/ff347eccc7ca9ffd.mp3", "She is an intelligent student.": "audio/cau/3510c8cda7bcca9d.mp3", "City life is interesting but stressful.": "audio/cau/d3da66e08dd099e1.mp3", "The film is interesting, and everyone is interested in it.": "audio/cau/4a91c463480dae58.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "Nam isn't at home now.": "audio/cau/064ea182a69f9ba0.mp3", "This is my bag, but that one isn't.": "audio/cau/93f1c4d3918a4422.mp3", "My sister was born in June.": "audio/cau/4e1a4e4846ca9984.mp3", "June is the sixth month of the year.": "audio/cau/36f258a6f0f15863.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "My teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/a4408f8940b23d7a.mp3", "Hoa is kind to everyone, but her brother is sometimes unkind.": "audio/cau/92eef49a76085d2d.mp3", "She smiled kindly at me.": "audio/cau/1f6770a4e642e4ad.mp3", "He kindly helped the old woman.": "audio/cau/355561eff4531966.mp3", "Thank you for your kindness.": "audio/cau/5a1909574805c9b6.mp3", "Small acts of kindness make people happy.": "audio/cau/591eeb7107114f71.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "Don't be lazy; do your homework.": "audio/cau/e8cd1ea0644d6fc1.mp3", "My cat is lazy and sleeps all day.": "audio/cau/fc1756a55ab83842.mp3", "Describe your hair by its length and colour.": "audio/cau/ad23f44edd907020.mp3", "The length of the table is two metres; it's long.": "audio/cau/84f01bf78c674bd1.mp3", "He had a difficult life when he was young.": "audio/cau/0e2c7b87c896e8b7.mp3", "City life is busy, and people live very fast.": "audio/cau/c7a56b97906b19d2.mp3", "I like noodles very much.": "audio/cau/7557928354c11c4a.mp3", "I like cats, but I dislike spiders.": "audio/cau/bdd9c25c87fbc823.mp3", "Minh likes playing football.": "audio/cau/8b21f729dbeb8632.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but I like art.": "audio/cau/e9144dc6f8053afb.mp3", "My lips are dry in winter.": "audio/cau/1c9b304cd5b4cdab.mp3", "She has a cut on her lip.": "audio/cau/7165be81ed38890d.mp3", "Close your lips to say /p/ and /b/.": "audio/cau/4f83c06fc89736ca.mp3", "My lips are dry, so I use lip balm.": "audio/cau/de1a7f6be5c72c2f.mp3", "Please listen to Lan's life story carefully.": "audio/cau/5e66ffcca03d62ba.mp3", "Minh is a good listener; he always listens to his friends.": "audio/cau/2a4b1d64993cd32a.mp3", "My mum is a good listener.": "audio/cau/c361fe2d103db23c.mp3", "The radio programme has many listeners.": "audio/cau/95723f87c574336f.mp3", "Thank you for listening.": "audio/cau/ee26d140bc752b99.mp3", "Nam is listening to music; he loves to listen to pop songs.": "audio/cau/8451afe66a0bd788.mp3", "We live in a small village.": "audio/cau/8438d091662da029.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside and have a happy life.": "audio/cau/a21ec63c6b42bc8d.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is very lively at night.": "audio/cau/f7f9de50246fc30a.mp3", "The market is lively and busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/be87297ba2d5a7fc.mp3", "The Mekong is a very long river.": "audio/cau/962b2d2abaecb121.mp3", "Mi has long hair, but Lan has short hair.": "audio/cau/21e34cbfd1358b0e.mp3", "Look at the board, please.": "audio/cau/512572a71fea8cfe.mp3", "Look at Minh! He is very good-looking today.": "audio/cau/3a8f3a88e8a3813b.mp3", "Mi is looking for her notebook in the bedroom.": "audio/cau/9cf0853b1a840504.mp3", "Look! Nam is looking at the picture on the wall.": "audio/cau/debf12a72a75e3eb.mp3", "Mi looks happy today.": "audio/cau/d53ae1b2afc27fcb.mp3", "Look at Nam; he looks tired.": "audio/cau/b6b16cdb7526bf98.mp3", "I love my family.": "audio/cau/02c5061798cc56cc.mp3", "My grandma is loving, and I love her a lot.": "audio/cau/588e4f5967e2076b.mp3", "What a lovely day!": "audio/cau/d4038241635895d6.mp3", "Her little sister is lovely.": "audio/cau/2566ff2d6fc065b2.mp3", "My mother is a loving person.": "audio/cau/5a0aadfbccb5dec1.mp3", "Hoa has a loving family, and she loves them a lot.": "audio/cau/dbfb0082905aad2d.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "My dad reads a magazine every morning.": "audio/cau/8b90ad3bcf582fbf.mp3", "Lan buys a science magazine at the bookshop.": "audio/cau/d382cbabedd00b5c.mp3", "Hoa uses red to mark exam days on her calendar.": "audio/cau/78135abe90fe0ad6.mp3", "Nam marks his due dates with a yellow pen.": "audio/cau/9321f43accfdd88b.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures.": "audio/cau/c554f0656d3ab896.mp3", "Match the names with the photos and connect them with lines.": "audio/cau/b9cb7dc9f6dfba6f.mp3", "We have our exams in May.": "audio/cau/596706c87a49f74e.mp3", "May is a hot month in the south.": "audio/cau/a0fc44757a99e818.mp3", "What does 'craft village' mean?": "audio/cau/4c5a16ea9baf9474.mp3", "What do these words mean? Let's check their meaning.": "audio/cau/2a235e867bbba30d.mp3", "I listen to music every evening.": "audio/cau/947b04b66aabe669.mp3", "Phong loves music, and he wants to be a musician.": "audio/cau/2a338296f019ee09.mp3", "Can you play a musical instrument?": "audio/cau/4b45a019b7f1df1c.mp3", "She comes from a musical family.": "audio/cau/da92e12306feca96.mp3", "Trinh Cong Son is a famous musician.": "audio/cau/44ebea42904bff46.mp3", "She wants to be a musician.": "audio/cau/a69499a50cc7cc48.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "There is a big park nearby.": "audio/cau/0bbea8d853e59092.mp3", "My school is near my house, and a market is nearby too.": "audio/cau/b046b21263949e43.mp3", "It's nearly six o'clock, so let's go home.": "audio/cau/245ae82d42650c9f.mp3", "Nam nearly missed the bus; he was almost late.": "audio/cau/b606a8d1edcf35c6.mp3", "He started a new life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c5e37434302d9841.mp3", "This bike is new, but that one is old.": "audio/cau/dae26bf3d19dc70a.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai.": "audio/cau/7c4c4da145e9a59d.mp3", "Lan is nice, and she always speaks nicely.": "audio/cau/b93deacf2eeac62d.mp3", "My little sister has a small nose.": "audio/cau/6421647206035545.mp3", "Our noses help us smell flowers and food.": "audio/cau/dcccb2cca40f7fd1.mp3", "People cover their noses because of the smoke.": "audio/cau/aa79601d7b5ed052.mp3", "My nose is small, but my brothers' noses are big.": "audio/cau/2f3b5fac291a3d0d.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "Teachers' Day is in November.": "audio/cau/9a405686c18ca5cb.mp3", "November is the eleventh month of the year.": "audio/cau/65b1d340b61ebb8c.mp3", "I am doing my homework now.": "audio/cau/c512289bbb165978.mp3", "It is raining now, so we stay at home.": "audio/cau/ac1b5a1cae28deb6.mp3", "I often get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/08008a46175a2d25.mp3", "Minh often reads books, but he never plays games.": "audio/cau/a29cadde346ad9ba.mp3", "My grandfather is seventy years old.": "audio/cau/ad4ec0973ce447a3.mp3", "My bike is old, but my sister's bike is new.": "audio/cau/dc292ece9d402a3f.mp3", "My brother is older than me.": "audio/cau/5670535468e3c19f.mp3", "This house is old, but that house is older.": "audio/cau/854d4f823994b96e.mp3", "This is the oldest pagoda in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/112d241056ccf384.mp3", "My grandpa is the oldest in my family.": "audio/cau/9f9847641a26a88e.mp3", "In my opinion, English is very interesting.": "audio/cau/8ea4c0f89c483967.mp3", "Lan has a different idea, but I respect her opinion.": "audio/cau/aab5c99fa33e70ce.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "My dad paid for the tickets.": "audio/cau/b4014cbad8c7d1da.mp3", "I paid 20,000 dong for the book.": "audio/cau/5359db2d26ba3bf6.mp3", "I like to paint pictures of flowers.": "audio/cau/f44d6f9b195d10c6.mp3", "We paint the house before Tet.": "audio/cau/d0f71b5285157539.mp3", "This is my parents' room.": "audio/cau/bdfd9116a79179f4.mp3", "I listen to my parents' advice.": "audio/cau/e362e871fe708e0d.mp3", "How much do you pay for a bowl of pho?": "audio/cau/e807ddb92a3f24db.mp3", "Mum paid for the books yesterday.": "audio/cau/15922b0414be0bc7.mp3", "You can make a payment by phone.": "audio/cau/364d4d9ceff8c0e1.mp3", "Cash payment is still popular.": "audio/cau/3becbcc878ec652a.mp3", "There are five people in my family.": "audio/cau/61d24a117613907d.mp3", "One person is late, but the other people are here.": "audio/cau/b4e5b7ba18b09096.mp3", "He is a kind and hard-working person.": "audio/cau/a7cc8ccdfee48d42.mp3", "One person came first, then many people came.": "audio/cau/e2f7a3bc001f7fc0.mp3", "This is my personal diary.": "audio/cau/4bb512632de09306.mp3", "Don't share personal information online.": "audio/cau/e4de8d484708e9e5.mp3", "Nam and Phong have very different personalities.": "audio/cau/ed82064de7c1fbe9.mp3", "Every person in my class has a different personality.": "audio/cau/ec68701ec7d6ee26.mp3", "Hoa has a friendly personality.": "audio/cau/5e968c0ca289e9bb.mp3", "Minh has a strong character and a kind personality.": "audio/cau/e35df7bcc2cd6179.mp3", "Personally, I prefer reading books.": "audio/cau/9aa0346277f99977.mp3", "The head teacher personally thanked us.": "audio/cau/46dcede164b9a7eb.mp3", "Look at the photos of my friends.": "audio/cau/8a988a56d17dddc5.mp3", "Mi takes a photo, and Lan takes many photos.": "audio/cau/df1811e9acc25b9a.mp3", "She wants to be a pianist.": "audio/cau/3e6b818c0e9b408a.mp3", "The pianist played a beautiful song.": "audio/cau/a3af9f032dc8612b.mp3", "Lan plays the piano every evening.": "audio/cau/3a62c8f36426a684.mp3", "My cousin is a pianist, and she teaches me the piano.": "audio/cau/af9a9112e50f8faa.mp3", "Look at the picture and describe the man.": "audio/cau/b1d73989f1f7619c.mp3", "Hoa draws a picture, and Nam takes a photo of it.": "audio/cau/40c2b9c3207a7713.mp3", "Mi draws beautiful pictures in art class.": "audio/cau/1037e2e30ff7fb85.mp3", "We took many photos and put the pictures on the wall.": "audio/cau/5ddc63bf192b9304.mp3", "Nam and Phong play football after school.": "audio/cau/4f990530a36010eb.mp3", "The children play in the playground at break time.": "audio/cau/01c38c5563b4ece0.mp3", "He is a good football player.": "audio/cau/2592e456810d1a0e.mp3", "Each player has three cards.": "audio/cau/2733b581f437ad82.mp3", "My puppy is very playful.": "audio/cau/2a941a50bd420b1b.mp3", "She has a playful smile.": "audio/cau/f0b4790d33181781.mp3", "The children play football in the playground.": "audio/cau/ba97d8ec376ab1f4.mp3", "Lan and Hoa play games in the school playground.": "audio/cau/16841dfb20eb6b7d.mp3", "Phong is playing football with his friends.": "audio/cau/fd009e447f675c7d.mp3", "Mi likes playing chess, and she is a good player.": "audio/cau/4637524c7f8926bf.mp3", "The pupils are playing in the yard.": "audio/cau/1178005118de5a59.mp3", "All pupils must wear uniforms.": "audio/cau/f08e1de8875b988c.mp3", "Can I ask you a question, Ms Hoa?": "audio/cau/7e99e348210556f2.mp3", "Nam asks a question, and Mi gives the answer.": "audio/cau/269c53bfb0db8e6f.mp3", "Please fill in the questionnaire.": "audio/cau/a95121e3928b213d.mp3", "We did a questionnaire about hobbies.": "audio/cau/c390090db32f59d5.mp3", "The teacher asks us three questions.": "audio/cau/9e7c27a7a37e13a0.mp3", "Read the questions carefully and write your answers.": "audio/cau/7fcc03272c2a6124.mp3", "The film was quite good.": "audio/cau/03ed8ad23ecd5167.mp3", "It's quite cold today.": "audio/cau/bae99bcbc3e62e6b.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "I rarely go to the cinema.": "audio/cau/665f28d3968d7eec.mp3", "Snow is rare in Ha Noi, so we rarely see it.": "audio/cau/651a9aa109c5d5ab.mp3", "I read a book before bed every night.": "audio/cau/52f4120305948c56.mp3", "Yesterday Mi read a story, because reading is her hobby.": "audio/cau/a206c7fecbd29a47.mp3", "My sister is a fast reader.": "audio/cau/c997b3414e90f2e3.mp3", "Lan is a good reader because she reads every day.": "audio/cau/804882ef0e352a60.mp3", "Reading helps us learn new words.": "audio/cau/a36b0142402545f6.mp3", "I read a story last night, and it was great.": "audio/cau/67941e0da7d7be3c.mp3", "I can't recall his name.": "audio/cau/b4e58316b0b55b64.mp3", "Can you recall the story?": "audio/cau/eae2dd9cbeeed3c8.mp3", "Do you remember Mi's birthday?": "audio/cau/32d012431282fc9b.mp3", "Remember to bring your book; don't forget it!": "audio/cau/b5bf1b42faeeef1f.mp3", "Your answer is right, Nam.": "audio/cau/de0207c9ebd60141.mp3", "Is this answer right or wrong?": "audio/cau/6f5632fc348cdcbc.mp3", "It's rude to talk with your mouth full.": "audio/cau/1a055a4bb8cbe14e.mp3", "Don't be rude to your teacher.": "audio/cau/47fa584daa4d36d7.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "Mi and I are in the same class.": "audio/cau/bc1a18955ee28275.mp3", "My bag is the same as yours, not different.": "audio/cau/b8e990694854227f.mp3", "I put my books in my schoolbag before school.": "audio/cau/c492164eb59da7f4.mp3", "My schoolbag is too heavy today.": "audio/cau/8d0a65c64cf8ce99.mp3", "She puts her books in her schoolbag.": "audio/cau/3f97f32ee71ad86a.mp3", "Lan is my schoolmate, not my classmate.": "audio/cau/e2d3147caa8ce83b.mp3", "I met a schoolmate at the bookshop.": "audio/cau/600fe95b9cf0ba63.mp3", "You seem very tired today, Nam.": "audio/cau/35d0d317c3b0474d.mp3", "The test seems easy, but be careful.": "audio/cau/464d526b15ed996d.mp3", "Air pollution is a serious problem.": "audio/cau/451a7484a9226374.mp3", "Our teacher looks serious today.": "audio/cau/128bbd7598114bcd.mp3", "I share my snacks with my friends.": "audio/cau/1c625e89c3a3a49f.mp3", "Mi likes to share, so she shares her umbrella with Lan.": "audio/cau/c01233d4e9f84bef.mp3", "My brother is short, but he plays basketball well.": "audio/cau/d8ddf117afef7434.mp3", "Minh is tall, but his brother is short.": "audio/cau/fa281035bc257ead.mp3", "Please shorten your report to one page.": "audio/cau/dee63c16ae986ee6.mp3", "The story is too long, so make it short.": "audio/cau/b95346b6a813da23.mp3", "Hoa is shy, so she speaks quietly.": "audio/cau/ef4e8e7e64f51655.mp3", "Lan was shy at first, but now she is confident.": "audio/cau/2433d33be7d55b3d.mp3", "The new girl smiled shyly at us.": "audio/cau/2d8e39ac5b046bf1.mp3", "He answered the question shyly.": "audio/cau/7bcc93093d7cfbd6.mp3", "Joining a club helped me overcome my shyness.": "audio/cau/cd71a7621cb6f760.mp3", "Her shyness makes it hard to make friends.": "audio/cau/d28374d8d05b64bb.mp3", "Life in my city is similar to life in yours.": "audio/cau/b89b4fb5bd2e62ee.mp3", "Hoa and Lan look similar, but their hobbies are different.": "audio/cau/612906abb392c0a7.mp3", "Ha Noi is planning to become a smart city.": "audio/cau/534a2d2742fd455c.mp3", "My smart cousin made an app for smartphones.": "audio/cau/a451335c10c8aa7f.mp3", "I'm so pleased you won the prize!": "audio/cau/345d567c5208a7af.mp3", "It was raining, so we stayed at home.": "audio/cau/d3e8c1c4c40bf63a.mp3", "Can you speak English well?": "audio/cau/7e70c8ed41dd5f73.mp3", "Mi spoke to her teacher after class.": "audio/cau/9631c4f9d08103cf.mp3", "She is a good English speaker.": "audio/cau/ad8983e10a3153eb.mp3", "Turn up the speaker, please.": "audio/cau/176c25890d4baf0b.mp3", "Speaking English is fun for me.": "audio/cau/5e0c5c8f032037bd.mp3", "Phong spoke very well at the speaking contest last week.": "audio/cau/a7b7e89c25abf298.mp3", "Our head teacher gave a short speech today.": "audio/cau/d7f9999a0661fac2.mp3", "Mi will speak first, then Nam will give his speech.": "audio/cau/e7405c38166acf2a.mp3", "Mi has long straight black hair.": "audio/cau/cbaed67b1a7560a4.mp3", "Lan has straight hair, but Hoa has curly hair.": "audio/cau/313ee46977f452e5.mp3", "Straighten your back when you sit.": "audio/cau/af19e8ff2e02c86a.mp3", "She straightened her hair for the party.": "audio/cau/176f7158402e877e.mp3", "Mi is a student at Ba Dinh Secondary School.": "audio/cau/569937b828afcac4.mp3", "Every student must study hard for the test.": "audio/cau/88443b78f0da0120.mp3", "Each student has a book, and all the students love our teacher.": "audio/cau/04de8679f0e55800.mp3", "I study English every evening.": "audio/cau/2a98035816ae0fe1.mp3", "Hoa is a studious student; she likes to study maths.": "audio/cau/81fcae64bc4c3e71.mp3", "Friends support each other in hard times.": "audio/cau/c25544ac51cf812c.mp3", "My parents are supportive; they always support me.": "audio/cau/bc09957a4f6cc0ae.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "My father is very tall.": "audio/cau/fbbb73825cd6c0b9.mp3", "Minh is tall, but Phong is short.": "audio/cau/dc16694351cdb299.mp3", "We are thankful to our teachers.": "audio/cau/7371a36dadb99e53.mp3", "Our teachers help us every day.": "audio/cau/7e121ff7d4ccdde3.mp3", "My brother is a teen, so he wants his own room.": "audio/cau/c8eb1ac059c2bb4a.mp3", "A teenager is a teen between thirteen and nineteen.": "audio/cau/d1532a0567e7f8bc.mp3", "Teenage students often use social media.": "audio/cau/6439a5aadf508eec.mp3", "She has two teenage sons.": "audio/cau/1b22257023981880.mp3", "Most teenagers like music and games.": "audio/cau/a9bbd7adccb33a47.mp3", "As a teenager, he loved football.": "audio/cau/64a6cc4e62c5025e.mp3", "The traffic in the city is terrible today.": "audio/cau/01ea841928344884.mp3", "The food was terrible, but the view was wonderful.": "audio/cau/93b659e2b5f66a2e.mp3", "I think he is a great person.": "audio/cau/9ae2e70b49a3159f.mp3", "I thought about his story, and I think it is true.": "audio/cau/9f8df7704c81c77d.mp3", "He is a creative thinker.": "audio/cau/f59f27869620f000.mp3", "Confucius was a great thinker.": "audio/cau/e0d23762cc277705.mp3", "That's a good thought!": "audio/cau/4c84ec15bb96b916.mp3", "I thought the test was easy.": "audio/cau/164ed73b13b1af06.mp3", "It was thoughtful of you to bring me flowers.": "audio/cau/baaadaf968d1f491.mp3", "My grandmother is a thoughtful person.": "audio/cau/a52bbd2ea31bf2b4.mp3", "What time is it now, Mum?": "audio/cau/1cbca6b4e0afa66c.mp3", "Look at the timetable; it is time for maths.": "audio/cau/9b6fb48058293171.mp3", "Let's look at our new timetable.": "audio/cau/b37160eda36c9395.mp3", "We have Maths on Monday according to the timetable.": "audio/cau/46e65b162f79e5db.mp3", "Mum opened a tin of fish.": "audio/cau/5e651202e8c5abce.mp3", "We recycle old tins at school.": "audio/cau/d4330e1cfd8f5ea3.mp3", "Is it true that Nam can sing well?": "audio/cau/b793f0302657ab80.mp3", "The story is true, not false.": "audio/cau/fd6a61c02d4b7fe6.mp3", "I'm truly sorry.": "audio/cau/e7ae5dcb584f8045.mp3", "It was a truly beautiful day.": "audio/cau/b7c3ef82c1d2475c.mp3", "Please tell me the truth.": "audio/cau/09d3635c1d77c2fb.mp3", "He always tells the truth.": "audio/cau/1b99124c4acee059.mp3", "Go straight and turn left at the corner.": "audio/cau/917966b2ec32c8a4.mp3", "A farm can turn food waste into biogas.": "audio/cau/52db34b37521af50.mp3", "This project turns food waste into energy.": "audio/cau/120924f8388b4ad5.mp3", "We turned old bottles into flower pots.": "audio/cau/36df7dee09156ada.mp3", "Don't be uncaring to your friends.": "audio/cau/04bee2cbc921dc0a.mp3", "He seemed cold and uncaring.": "audio/cau/d166d31db07821d4.mp3", "The new neighbour seems unfriendly.": "audio/cau/0e1c5a5441788b1d.mp3", "Don't be unfriendly to new classmates.": "audio/cau/6506d305aef12ce1.mp3", "The shop assistant was unhelpful.": "audio/cau/72e4a1fc9b333f47.mp3", "This map is unhelpful.": "audio/cau/a647e15849c7448e.mp3", "It's unkind to laugh at others.": "audio/cau/192d5bf86ba98a81.mp3", "She said some unkind words.": "audio/cau/47391550bf40693a.mp3", "It's unusual to see snow in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/e05b05b1ff1ae1b4.mp3", "She has an unusual name.": "audio/cau/8b34ff4e430332df.mp3", "We use computers to make our visual story.": "audio/cau/1f9e65093a2c0cf1.mp3", "This app is very useful, and I use it every day.": "audio/cau/7434eb2ec1577d85.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "This broken umbrella is useless.": "audio/cau/87f4d5c1e27eee06.mp3", "It's useless to cry now.": "audio/cau/d2efa23c3f23f8b7.mp3", "Facebook has millions of users.": "audio/cau/3955ede83592bd40.mp3", "Enter your user name here.": "audio/cau/8f967e17a7ac312d.mp3", "I got up at the usual time.": "audio/cau/290a01bde4a43987.mp3", "As usual, she was late.": "audio/cau/dbda02aadf09e9b8.mp3", "I usually get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/56d7578c4454be93.mp3", "Mi usually walks to school, so it is unusual for her to be late.": "audio/cau/3e33c944667515e1.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "The view from my window is beautiful.": "audio/cau/a2cd78af04fe64cc.mp3", "In my view, homework is useful.": "audio/cau/1db29f08206967db.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "She has long wavy hair.": "audio/cau/28e9b1e69bb80048.mp3", "Draw a wavy line.": "audio/cau/e4448f8706e8a0ab.mp3", "I play football twice a week.": "audio/cau/f42675610892504d.mp3", "Every week we have a weekly test.": "audio/cau/9b6cd05f35e45234.mp3", "I go to school on weekdays.": "audio/cau/9d7aaefa6fa649b1.mp3", "The museum is quiet on weekdays.": "audio/cau/eb912e589405ca96.mp3", "I visit my grandparents at the weekend.": "audio/cau/5f08fce8800a0ef9.mp3", "On weekdays I study, but at the weekend I relax.": "audio/cau/7161d9e546310ce2.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "We went to the summer camp last June.": "audio/cau/577b7f143e454603.mp3", "Mi usually goes by bus, but yesterday she went by bike.": "audio/cau/bf4b0b541f770b47.mp3", "Where do you live, Lan?": "audio/cau/0c6d7d3df1a25694.mp3", "Where is my schoolbag, Mum?": "audio/cau/57a3c3d221996a0d.mp3", "She is wearing a white T-shirt.": "audio/cau/2026d341ee2515db.mp3", "My cat is white, but my dog is black.": "audio/cau/6830d20c0f7fe4b8.mp3", "We had a wonderful holiday.": "audio/cau/b731d7b223c248dd.mp3", "What a wonderful idea!": "audio/cau/83d5b6cb831dd9a7.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "The worker wears a helmet.": "audio/cau/9c235c7e97cd46ce.mp3", "Factory workers work long hours.": "audio/cau/dd3d0d4cd13eb0b4.mp3", "My mum is working in the garden now.": "audio/cau/0fc0a939dbaf61f1.mp3", "Dad works hard, and today he is working late.": "audio/cau/8fff1884b3def435.mp3", "This is the worst film I've ever seen.": "audio/cau/2b6b7e86b637f5bc.mp3", "Monday is the worst day of the week for me.": "audio/cau/40b0df75c1307d68.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3", "My uncle is young and active.": "audio/cau/25ab8c1b23e804a5.mp3", "Nam is younger than Minh, but they are both young.": "audio/cau/ae83efbb6b4f31bc.mp3"};
